[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:A Clear Conscience]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:10.18]How did Sam get his money back? | 萨姆是怎么拿回钱的？
[00:14.70]The whole village soon learnt that a large sum of money had been lost. | 全村很快得知丢了一大笔钱。
[00:21.01]Sam Benton, the local butcher, | 当地的屠户萨姆·本顿
[00:24.33]had lost his wallet while taking his savings to the post office. | 在把存款送往邮局的途中丢了钱包。
[00:30.29]Sam was sure that the wallet must have been found by one of the villagers, | 萨姆确信钱包一定是被某个村民捡到了，
[00:36.74]but it was not returned to him. | 可是却不见有人来还给他。
[00:40.43]Three months passed, and then one morning, Sam found his wallet outside his front door. | 3个月过去了，后来在一个早晨，萨姆在自己的大门外发现了他的钱包。
[00:49.07]It had been wrapped up in newspaper and it contained half the money he had lost, | 钱包用报纸包着，里面有他丢失的一半的钱，
[00:56.09]together with a note which said: | 而且还附着一张字条，上面写着：
[00:59.06]'A thief, yes, but only 50 per cent a thief!' | “一个小偷，是的，但只是一个50%的小偷！”
[01:05.13]Two months later, | 又过了两个月，
[01:06.81]some more money was sent to Sam with another note: | 萨姆又收到了一些钱，并附有另一张字条：
[01:12.12]'Only 25 per cent a thief now!' | “现在只是一个25%的小偷了！”
[01:16.32]In time, all Sam's money was paid back in this way. | 最后，萨姆所有的钱都以同样的方式还了回来。
[01:22.34]The last note said: 'I am 100 per cent honest now!' | 最后那张字条上写着：“我现在是一个100%的诚实人了！”
